+- status `KLEAN_NO_OBLIGATIONS`;
+- `lake clean`: exit 0, empty output;
+- `lake build`: exit 0;
+- obligation count 0;
+- target null;
+- designated sorry count 0; and
+- all Stage 1, Stage 3, and generated-tree hashes equal to the independently
